[[File:Steam debug mode general launch options.png|300px|right|thumb|Entering <code>-debug</code> in the [[Steam]]'s launch options]]
'''Debug mode''' is a modified game state in [[Project Zomboid]]. In this mode, the player has access to multiple developer tools which can spawn items, enable various cheats, teleport the player to any destination, and way more.

To enable debug mode, add <code>-debug</code> to the game's [[startup parameters]] prior to booting the game. Various debugging tools will then be available in the game:
* [[Debug scenario]]s
* [[Debug menu]]
* [[Lua debugger]]
* [[#Contextual menus|Debug contextual menus]]
* And more...
<!-- * [[Debug contextual menus]] -->

== Activating debug mode ==
To activate debug mode, the usual way is to add <code>-debug</code> to the game's [[startup parameters]] in [[Steam]]:
# Right-click the game in the ''Steam Library'', a menu will pop up.
# Click ''Properties''. A new modal window will appear.
# By default the 'general' tab in the modal window should be opened, but if not, click it.
# Look under ''Launch Options'' → ''Selected Launch Option''. 
# Add <code>-debug</code> to the field.
# Close the window and launch the game.
# You should notice the menu has some extra elements, notably with the ''Reset Lua'' button on the bottom right, and the [[Debug scenario]]s available in the middle of the menu.

{{Note|For a more in-depth guide, you will want to read [[Startup parameters#Usage|Startup parameters]].}}

== Function tools ==
The '''function tools''' are mostly tools and editors which can be accessed using {{Key|Fn}} keys. Below is a table with the editor tools associated to their respective keybinds.
{| class="wikitable"
! Keybind !! Editor tool
|-
| {{Key|F2}} || [[In-game map editor]]
|-
| {{Key|F3}} || Unloads the character models. Your player shadow is still here and zombies will become shadow zombies.
|-
| {{Key|F6}} || Animation states and variables UI.
|-
| {{Key|F7}} || [[Vehicle editor]]
|-
| {{Key|shift}} + {{Key|F7}} || [[Attachment editor]]
|-
| {{Key|F8}} || [[Annotated map editor]]
|-
| {{Key|F9}} || [[Seam editor]]
|-
| {{Key|shift}} + {{Key|F9}} || [[Depthmap editor]]
|-
| {{Key|F11}} || [[Lua debugger]]
|}

== Contextual menus ==
:[[File:Debug On 128.png|thumb|128px|right]]
There are new contextual menus available in the debug mode available from right click menu.  Debug related right click menu's and information are marked with the green bug icon.

